# The dragon: big, round and a bit dopey. Red with a golden belly, stubby
# wings, little horns, sleepy eyes, a spiky back and a long tail with a
# spade on the end. Faces +z; its centre is x = 15.
# Parts: the body (everything but the wings), and the two wings, which flap
# from their shoulders; each wing's root reaches into the body, so no gap opens.
size 31 26 44
voxel 0.075
smooth 2
colors
  r dragonRed
  d dragonDark
  y dragonBelly
  h horn
  w white
  k ink
part body pivot 15 9.5 23
# Stubby legs.
ellipsoid 9.5 3 17 3 3.5 3 d
ellipsoid 20.5 3 17 3 3.5 3 d
ellipsoid 9.5 3 28 3 3.5 3 d
ellipsoid 20.5 3 28 3 3.5 3 d
# A big round body, golden underneath.
ellipsoid 15 9.5 23 7.5 6.5 10 r
paint ellipsoid 15 5.5 20 6 4.5 10 y
# The tail, tapering away behind, with a spade at the tip.
ellipsoid 15 7 33 4 3.5 4 r
ellipsoid 15 5.5 37 2.8 2.5 3.4 r
ellipsoid 15 4.5 40.5 1.8 1.6 2.6 r
ellipsoid 15 4.5 42.5 2.6 0.9 1.4 d
# Spikes down the back.
ellipsoid 15 16.2 19 1 1.5 1.3 h
ellipsoid 15 16.2 23 1 1.5 1.3 h
ellipsoid 15 15.6 27 1 1.4 1.3 h
ellipsoid 15 12.8 31 0.9 1.3 1.2 h
# The neck and head: a big round head with a long snout.
ellipsoid 15 13 13 4 4.5 4.5 r
paint ellipsoid 15 10.5 11 3.4 3.4 3 y
ellipsoid 15 17 8.5 5.5 4.5 5 r
ellipsoid 15 15 3.5 3.8 2.8 4 r
# Nostrils, horns, and big sleepy eyes.
paint ellipsoid 13.4 16.4 0.5 0.7 0.6 1.5 k
paint ellipsoid 16.6 16.4 0.5 0.7 0.6 1.5 k
ellipsoid 11.5 21.6 9.5 1 2.4 1.2 h
ellipsoid 18.5 21.6 9.5 1 2.4 1.2 h
paint ellipsoid 11.6 18.6 5 1.7 1.5 3 w
paint ellipsoid 18.4 18.6 5 1.7 1.5 3 w
paint ellipsoid 11.9 18.2 5 0.9 0.9 3 k
paint ellipsoid 18.1 18.2 5 0.9 0.9 3 k
# Sleepy lids.
paint ellipsoid 11.6 19.8 5 1.9 0.7 3 d
paint ellipsoid 18.4 19.8 5 1.9 0.7 3 d

# Stubby wings, up and out, flapping from the shoulders.
part wingRight pivot 10.5 14.5 22 parent body
ellipsoid 6 15 22 5 1.1 4.5 d
ellipsoid 11 13.8 22 2 1.6 3 d
part wingLeft pivot 19.5 14.5 22 parent body
ellipsoid 24 15 22 5 1.1 4.5 d
ellipsoid 19 13.8 22 2 1.6 3 d
